          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            At {fmtInt(VA_PER_STRAP)} VA per strap under 220.14(I). These counts apply to non-dwelling occupancies
            only — in a dwelling there is no maximum.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-slate-500 bg-slate-50">
                  <th class="py-3 px-5 font-semibold">Circuit</th>
                  <th class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold">Load type</th>
